                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/949/> ;
                 rdfs:label "Range of use of the platform boarding aid"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Information of the train access level for which the boarding aid can be used. Data is presented as the vertical difference that is overcome by the platform boarding aid in millimetres. The value â€œ0â€ means that the platform is not equipped with a platform boarding aid."@en .


